Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.49,0:00:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye, Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you Monday! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Again and again...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine. Move it, you're gonna make me late. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Work again? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, whatever. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work, Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything else I can help with? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's fine. You can go home now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.17,0:02:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, there's all sorts of jobs. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you up to with that book? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm finding a job! Just like Fujimoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, you wanna help pay back the loan too? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.89,0:02:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I can get up bright and early and deliver newspapers! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:03:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A sleepyhead like you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.19,0:03:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about delivering pizza to people's houses? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We both know you'd just get lost. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then maybe I could help out as a mover. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll stumble and break their vases. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then what should I do? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.09,0:03:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I give up! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's torn. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The poor thing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, he's all fixed up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But there's something else I wanted to ask you... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're the guy with the umbrella! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for letting me keep it so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you two already know each other? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.99,0:04:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Ueda. I run this bakery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.87,0:04:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato lives in one of my apartments. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She usually helps out at Yomogi Nursery. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She said she was looking for a job, and I thought of your shop. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. We've been really busy, it'd be great if you could help out on the weekends. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At least until my hands heal. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're all messed up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was being an airhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She hurt herself just recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but when it gets busy he has a lot of trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you can help out, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. I'll be glad to, boss! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.29,0:05:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And, uh... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Ohmura Yumi. Pleased to meet you, Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best, Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm done changing! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great, you got the uniform perfect. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now what do I do? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... First, when a customer comes, say "Welcome!". 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.35,0:05:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After that, listen to their order, and put their cake into a box. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One of these? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll run the register, so you get their money... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I say "Thank you!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna give it a shot? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm. I'd like some shortcake and a montblanc. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shortcake and montblanc. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:13.17,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Not cheesecake, apple pie. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cheese, apple... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:15.12,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,And a lemon tart! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lemon? Um... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And a creampuff, please. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Er, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shortcake and a montblanc... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then apple pie, a lemon tart, and a creampuff. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're great, Yumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put them in the box, Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, shortcake{\fscx200}-{\fscx81} 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down and get another piece. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then a montblanc, and... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apple pie, a lemon tart, and a creampuff. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here it is! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, last but not least... 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why, aren't you enthusiastic. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you just need a little more practice. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Marina and her mommy! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's a baker!{I so want to use patissier, but allegedly five-year-olds don't know that word. ; ;} 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm a baker today! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of cake would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We came to pick up my birthday cake today. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's your birthday? Congratulations! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Box that up for them. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll let you take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here! Sorry to keep you waiting! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.79,0:08:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why's this still here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe we gave them the wrong{\fscx200}-{\fscx81} 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go catch Marina! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marina! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have one of these, and one of those. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'd like a montblanc and some cheesecake. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worn out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work, Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, a gift. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.51,0:08:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi will love it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Io{\fscx200}-{\fscx81}? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He says to pretend he's a stuffed animal! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Tomorrow too? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi, you can go home too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about cleanup? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're hurt, don't overwork yourself. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving, boss. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be leaving now! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Good work. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nothing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look worried, Yumi. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about the boss. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The boss? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something's bothering him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried asking him, but he said it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The store's doing well. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then what could he be worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's a loan? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery is having a lot of trouble with them. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me that's why you got a job here, Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you're amazing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Miss Sayaka and Fujimoto are amazing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I want to help them out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help the boss out, too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, this ain't half bad! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanting to help someone but not being able to must hurt. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll find out what's bothering the boss! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, whatever. Just don't say something dumb and get yourself fired. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you do, I won't get any more of this cake. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you could get another job, though. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like at a sushi bar! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.97,0:11:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or a steakhouse! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or sit-down Chinese! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! What's your next job? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm staying at the bakery! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you put these cookies on the shelf? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, you're in charge up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did he just sigh looking at me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did he? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:11:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is the boss worried about me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask him what it is! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.83,0:12:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Can you do it casually? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, um... 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had something I wanted to ask you casually! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:12:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato... 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something you're worried about? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.69,0:13:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm fine. Nothing at all. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Yumi said you keep getting lost in thought, and acting like you want to say something. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's weird! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing she needs to worry about. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Putting it that way just makes it seem weirder. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.27,0:13:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's helping out until I'm all healed. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like a cake? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was going to visit Chitose, and thought I'd buy a gift. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't had a cake from Tirol in a while. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, you used to order for your husband's birthday. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka's husband? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Women normally have those when they get married, yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I've never met him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They must have split up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka seemed so lonely... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't bother her about it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She probably doesn't want to talk about it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you just trying to keep it hush-hush that you got a job to help the nursery? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has stuff they don't want to talk about. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the boss at Tirol? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if Yumi wants to know... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do I do then? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Check it out on the down-low. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not that you're any good at {\i1}that{\i0} . 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess this counts. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.05,0:15:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm checking things out on the down-low. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you're just like a detective! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A detective? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is what a detective is? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They check things out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Prove motives and alibis. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And they search and ask around. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And tail people. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so cool! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, detectives work alone! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got this all wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a detective today. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A detective? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you noticed anything strange around Tirol? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not reall. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! The boss is worried about something! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The boss is... 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Worried? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have any ideas? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.11,0:16:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, nothing{\fscx200}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At al? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tirol's cakes are pretty popular. Maybe it's something other than work? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This ain't gonna cut it. I'll use my own informants. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Informants? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.85,0:16:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way I can do that! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a tough nut to crack, Genko. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you came to sweet-talk someone, you're at the wrong place! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I'll just take this and leave. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:17:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just came to eat my baumkuchen, didn't you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you figured me out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.01,0:17:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.77,0:17:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good job. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a detective! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So far I've found out that Tirol's cakes are popular, 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and that he might be worried about things other than work. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I learned that he's always giving chocolate to the kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.65,0:17:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,asking how people are feeling, and that everyone loves his cakes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And he gave me a chocolate!{*}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The boss is so kind to everyone! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, now let's to tail him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough, Kobato. Let's just go home. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he waiting for someone? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't follow him in there, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone's coming! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's a date? Is that why he didn't tell me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do I do, Kobato!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down, Yumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's gonna see us! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.68,0:18:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:18:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.40,0:19:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Owwww... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine. Never mind that, who were you meeting before? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, it was an interview. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For a new employee. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A new employee? Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you're around on the weekends, 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.09,0:19:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I haven't been able to give Yumi time off in so long. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Time off? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought she was tired out, and that might be how she got hurt. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss... That's what you were worried about? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. You work so hard... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I had to do something to recognize that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:20:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I enjoy working with you! I don't want time off! 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just seeing everyone overjoyed at Tirol's cakes every day... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just being with you is enjoyable! 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I got hurt by...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.35,0:20:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's so cute! 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi, you made this? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.78,0:20:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got hurt ditzing out while practicing making cakes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I didn't tell you I was studying so I could help out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.31,0:20:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we give it a try? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's tasty. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.48,0:21:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once the new girl is here, I'll make time for us to work on making cakes together. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, you figured something out? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Detective Kobato cracked the case! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The boss wanted to give Yumi time off, 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.21,0:21:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but Yumi wanted to do more for the boss. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was a wonderful case where they realized each other's feelings! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well. I got more baumkuchen anyway. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.45,0:21:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not from Tirol, is it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.31,0:21:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you've brought some home before.. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does it have anything to do with your informants? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:22:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right! Your score this time... 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I ate your cake, so I'll take it easy on you. 100 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.31,0:22:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.51,0:22:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.36,0:22:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have something for you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A chocolate I got from work! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Work? You? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.05,0:22:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.66,0:22:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So please, take a little off time and focus on school. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.45,0:22:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter if you try, it probably won't do any good. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.11,0:22:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Meanie! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.20,0:22:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't kill yourself overdoing it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.29,0:22:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you're worried about me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks so much! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.37,0:22:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you just do something about the scribbles on your face! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he wrote 100 points! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.37,0:22:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He scribbled 100 points. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.13,0:22:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong! Fujimoto, you're a meanie! 50 points! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going on about? 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:12.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.09,0:01:20.39,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:30.19,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:35.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:43.74,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:49.42,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:54.63,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.63,0:02:00.93,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:06.60,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:13.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:22.03,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Detective Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:08.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:15.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:23.63,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:32.26,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.59,0:23:43.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.65,0:23:45.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:54.41,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:24:01.50,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.29,0:24:11.01,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.09,0:24:15.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.89,0:24:28.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}...Silver Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
